   "flags": {},
   "order": 2,
   "mode": 0,
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "title": "Tailored for this setup",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "**Upscale, SeedVR2 3B (faithful)**\n\nRestores detail at the new size while keeping the image as it is: photos, renders, textures.\n\n**All settings are in the groups on the left** (Main settings, Fine-tuning); each title says what it does. The nodes they feed show the same values greyed out: nothing to change there.\n\n- **Scale factor**: 2 by default. 4 works but a 1 MP input becomes 16 MP (slow).\n- **Colour match**: lab = closest to the original colours; try wavelet if colours look flat.\n- **Model**: 7b only if the installer fetched it (`--seedvr2-7b`). Heavier on 16 GB RAM.\n- Alpha is preserved. Output: `output/upscale/`"
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "**Upscale, SeedVR2 3B (faithful)**\n\nRestores detail at the new size while keeping the image as it is: photos, renders, textures.\n\n**All settings are in the groups on the left** (Main settings, Fine-tuning); each title says what it does. The nodes they feed show the same values greyed out: nothing to change there.\n\n- **Scale factor**: 2 by default. 4 works but a 1 MP input becomes 16 MP (slow).\n- **Colour match**: lab = closest to the original colours; try wavelet if colours look flat.\n- **Model**: 7b only if the installer fetched it (`--seedvr2-7b`). Heavier on 16 GB RAM.\n- Alpha is preserved. Output: `output/upscale/`"
   },
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
